<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, upon the recommendation of the Board, appoint any person with appropriate skills or expertise to serve as the Director General of the Institute and shall vest in him such powers and impose upon him such duties as may be determined by the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
