<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General shall perform such further duties as the Board may from time to time direct."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
