<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Director General is temporarily absent from Malaysia or is unable through illness or any other reason, to perform the duties of his office, the Director General shall appoint any person to carry out the duties of the Director General during such temporary absence or inability. Appointment of Deputy Director Generals"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
