<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~part_VII__cl_60__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "All acts and things done by any person or authority on behalf of the Institute in preparation for or in anticipation of the enactment of this Act and any expenditure incurred in relation thereto shall be deemed to have been authorized under this Act, provided that the acts and things done are consistent with the general intentions and purposes of this Act; and all rights and obligations acquired or incurred as a result of the doing of those acts or things including any expenditure incurred in relation thereto shall, upon the coming into operation of this Act, be deemed to be the rights and obligations of the Institute."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
