<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~part_VI__cl_45__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An assigned officer may, without payment, request to obtain or retain samples of a physical entity from any person in possession of such physical entity, which he believes contains information that is connected to or relevant for the purposes of road safety research, and, upon receipt of such sample, examine or analyze all its physical or chemical constituents and anything that he believes is used or capable of being used for the design, construction, manufacture, storage, distribution or sale of that physical entity."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
