<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board shall meet for the dispatch of its business at least once in every three months at such time and place as the Chairman may determine from time to time."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
