<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "At any meeting of the Board, five members shall form a quorum."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
