<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman shall preside over all meetings of the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subparagraph (3), if for any reason the Chairman is unable to attend a meeting of the Board, the Deputy Chairman shall exercise the powers of the Chairman during the absence of the Chairman."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/2/eng@> .
